  "description": "Shared TS/Kotlin conformance vectors for the PCA-RUNTIME-SCHEDULE-1 evaluator (SchedulePolicyV1 / ScheduleEvaluationInput -> ScheduleDecision). Ground truth for decision precedence and boundary semantics is backend/src/schedule/engine.ts, policy.ts and timezone.ts (read-only reference for this contract), cross-checked against the pre-existing backend/test/schedule/engine.test.mjs assertions where a vector reuses that scenario (noted per-vector). Do not hand-edit expected fields without re-deriving them from the documented precedence in engine.ts's evaluateSchedule doc comment.",
  "notes": [
    "Weekday indices are 0=Sunday .. 6=Saturday, matching Date.prototype.getDay() in UTC (see backend/src/schedule/timezone.ts WeekdayIndex).",
    "All *AtUtc / nowUtc / lastPolicySyncAtUtc fields are ISO-8601 instants; null means absent (e.g. lastPolicySyncAtUtc: null represents a device that has never completed a policy sync).",
    "expected.reason is intentionally NOT part of this contract: reason strings are documentation-quality free text and may differ verbatim between the TS reference and the Kotlin conforming implementation without being a semantic mismatch. Only decision, matchedWindowId, matchedWindowIds, intendedDecision, remainingMinutesToday and hasConfigErrors are compared.",
